  "details": "VRChat Version: 2021.1.5p3, happened on previous version(s) too.\nDescription of the bug: There is an ongoing issue where friend requests appear as though they are sent and tell you that they are, when in reality the game completely fails to send them, and returns an error in the logs, never arriving at their destination.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): It happens just playing normally. Launch the game, and you will either be able to send requests, or you will not be able to. I am curious if this has to do with the fact that the moderations check failed and yet let me in anyway though.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): I have several screenshots showing it happening at different times, but due to personal information being shown I will submit an email to Support with the full log.",
